    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Secure loading and documentation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Confirm that the vehicle is centered on the rail flatbed or enclosed trailer, with wheel chocks and straps tightened to manufacturer specifications. Cross‑check the loading manifest against the digital audit and attach a copy of the FASTag receipt, battery test report, and fuel level certification to the shipment paperwork.</p>
